[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 26642.15, "timestamp": "07:24:02", "text": "我只是閉上眼睛做了點什麼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26645.03, "timestamp": "07:24:05", "text": "我不知道。  但這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26651.91, "timestamp": "07:24:11", "text": "並非事實。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26656.788, "timestamp": "07:24:16", "text": "哦，是的。是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26659.43, "timestamp": "07:24:19", "text": "喬，我們現在就打算這樣花掉它。真的嗎？不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26664.39, "timestamp": "07:24:24", "text": "，這不是真的。  你花了這麼長時間。當我們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26666.948, "timestamp": "07:24:26", "text": "去的時候，當著鈴木、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 26670.948, "timestamp": "07:24:30", "text": "壽司、荒木和其他人面，你對此事隻字未提。我的意思是，"}]